834205748679' title=''/><author><name>Ghost</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18160268406450071591</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='33' height='21' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-gp5gCtMRExU/Tb2cxgxkvrI/AAAAAAAAAAU/JrX_Zi1oOck/s220/AEBlogBG.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/a-commissarina-rises-wendy-j-olsons.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5656887198160858563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5656887198160858563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1371166845"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2012 at 1:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-801514781830216076</id><published>2012-10-19T13:15:46.800-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-19T13:15:46.800-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another invader seized Farrar’s shrieking two-year...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;Another invader seized Farrar’s shrieking two-year-old son from his crib and refused to allow his parents to comfort him.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;“My son screamed for his mother for what seemed like an eternity,” Farrar later recalled. “I will never forget the hopeless feeling of not being able to comfort my son or daughter.”&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All the forces of Earth, Heaven, and Hell would not prevent me from tracking down every last one of the criminal scumbags responsible for such an act and meting out my own brand of justice to them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5656887198160858563/comments/default/801514781830216076'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5656887198160858563/comments/default/801514781830216076'/><link rel='alternate' type='te