img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/a-commissarina-rises-wendy-j-olsons.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5656887198160858563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5656887198160858563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-767741364"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 19, 2012 at 10:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1298246436933598390</id><published>2012-10-19T09:36:41.676-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-19T09:36:41.676-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Emperor, we come for you!&amp;quot;  -Paul Atrei...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Emperor, we come for you!&amp;quot;  -Paul Atreides, Kwisatz Haderach&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The truth is stranger than fiction . . . &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;And he said, Woe unto you also, ye lawyers! for ye lade men with burdens &lt;br /&gt;grievous to be borne, and ye yourselves touch not the burdens with one of &lt;br /&gt;your fingers.&amp;quot; -Jesus of Nazareth, Christ (Luke 11:46)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;But woe unto you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! for ye shut up the &lt;br /&gt;kingdom of heaven against men: for ye neither go in yourselves, neither &lt;br /&gt;suffer ye them that are entering to go in.&amp;quot; -Jesus of Nazareth, Christ (Mat 23:13)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Come soon, Lord Jesus.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5656887198160858563/comments/default/1298246436933598390'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5656887198160858563/comments/default/1298246436933598390'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/a-commissarina-rises-wendy-j-olsons.html?showComment=13